WEBVTT

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:05.310
Flying in the sky

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:07.440
<i>takaku habatake</i>
Soar high up

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:10.190
<i>oozora o dokomade mo</i>
Anywhere across the sky

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.030
Shining Finger

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:13.900
<i>kagayaku hikari ga</i>
The shining light

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:17.280
<i>chi no hate terashi kiseki o yobu spell</i>
A spell that spreads
miracles throughout the world

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:20.740
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:26.420
<i>furimukazu aruku no sa</i>
Walk forward and never turn back

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:32.670
<i>mugen no chikara ga aru</i>
I have an unlimited power

00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:40.100
<i>nando demo tamesu no sa</i>
I must test myself many times

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:48.440
<i>donna ni kurushikutemo yaritogeru</i>
Do it all no matter how painful

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:51.730
<i>ai wa itsumo kono mune ni</i>
Love is always in my heart

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:55.240
<i>towa ni kieru koto wa nai</i>
It will never fade

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>kono te ga sakendeiru</i>
My hand cries out loud

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.330
<i>ashita e to hashire</i>
To run toward tomorrow

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:04.080
Bright you now

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:08.580
<i>kimi ga egaita mirai e no shinario wa</i>
The future that you envision

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:10.920
Shining Finger

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:12.590
<i>yume o tsukamou</i>
Take hold of our dreams

00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:16.130
<i>subete wa omou mama ni I get a chance</i>
Everything will go
my way if I get a chance

00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:24.930
I would like to, if I may...

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:29.190
...provide you with an explanation
of the Gundam Fight.

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:32.440
It all began in the recent past,
about 60 years ago.

00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:36.940
People had left the filthy Earth
to live in Colonies in space.

00:01:36.940 --> 00:01:40.700
And in order to avoid all-out
war among the Colony nations...

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:43.660
...a competition is held every four
years with representatives...

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:46.870
...from each nation piloting
Gundam machines...

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:48.580
...in what's know as
"Gundam Fights."

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:52.210
And the pilots fight. And they
fight. And they continue fighting...

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:55.920
...until the nation represented
by the last standing Gundam...

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:59.260
...earns the right to rule
all the Colony nations.

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:04.180
It's as though they've based war
on principles of sportsmanship.

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:07.890
However,
one problem still remains.

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:10.890
This competition takes place
on Earth.

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:12.520
That's right.

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:15.780
This filthy planet
on which we live.

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:18.490
But this time around...

00:02:18.490 --> 00:02:21.450
...there seems to be something
different about the tournament.

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:24.030
Hey, you over there!

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:27.250
Do you remember seeing this guy?

00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:31.330
Well, now...

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:34.340
...how might this photo
affect today's fight?

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:40.090
Neo France - Gundam Rose

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:37.710
Today's opponent,
representing Neo France...

00:02:37.710 --> 00:02:39.760
...is George de Sand
and the Gundam Rose!

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:41.800
And now!

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:46.430
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:52.440
Challenge! The Red Rose Knight

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:51.400
Challenge! The Red Rose Knight

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:07.580
It is dangerous here,
Miss Maria Louise.

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:09.910
The match is about to
commence very shortly.

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:11.870
For your own safety, please
return to your seat at once.

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:13.570
May I watch from here?

00:03:13.570 --> 00:03:14.960
Certainly not!

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:17.210
What if something terrible
should happen to you?

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:18.920
We're fine.

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:20.550
Besides, he will surely win!

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:22.720
George de Sand...

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:28.390
All right! Let's get on with it!

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:32.100
When I beat you,
I'll make a name for myself!

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:36.270
What an insult to have to face
such a lowly Gundam.

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:39.940
Choosing you for my match
in the presence of the princess...

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:41.440
...was an oversight on my part.

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:43.150
Shut your trap!

00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:44.840
I'll beat you bad.

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:48.740
Gundam Fight Standby!

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:51.080
Very well.
Ready...!

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:52.460
Go!

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:54.870
What the...?!

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:12.730
Why, that's Neo Japan's...

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:14.350
...Shining Gundam?

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:19.150
Sorry to interrupt, but I want
you to fight me first.

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:22.280
If you want, both of
you can come at me.

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:23.320
I refuse.

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:23.900
What?

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:26.910
Article 5, Gundam Fight
International Regulations.

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:29.890
"A match shall only be held
on a one-on-one basis."

00:04:29.890 --> 00:04:33.580
Aren't you aware that it is in
bad form to intrude on a match?

00:04:34.410 --> 00:04:37.000
Just ignore this
second-rate Gundam.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:39.120
Come on.
You're going to fight me.

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:43.090
What makes you think
you can just put me down?

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:45.260
Fine. If that's how you want it!

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:47.220
I don't care who I beat!

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:56.230
What?

00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:01.650
Article 1, Gundam Fight
International Regulations.

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:04.940
"A unit whose head section has
been destroyed is disqualified."

00:05:04.940 --> 00:05:05.650
Correct?

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:10.910
Your appointment
has been canceled.

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:14.620
My, my. You have all the
tact of a rampaging bull.

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:15.830
What?

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:20.590
Gundam Fighters are like knights
who fight duels for their countries.

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:23.050
Fighting simply for the
sake of fighting...

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:24.920
...is the pinnacle of ignorance...

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:27.430
Just shut up, already!

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:28.760
Rose!

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:43.230
You...!

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:54.580
Gundam Fighter of Neo Japan,
Domon Kasshu!

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:58.250
I do not wish to fight you.

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:00.830
Please never appear
before me again.

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:04.440
W-wait!

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:14.350
You are amazing, George.

00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:15.770
George de Sand...

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:17.770
...that is why you are my prince.

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:45.240
Good.
All we had to do was change parts.

00:06:45.240 --> 00:06:46.420
Listen!

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:48.510
We've received a serious
complaint from the...

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:50.810
...International Gundam
Fight Committee!

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:53.510
I received the fighting
signal first.

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:54.510
There's no problem.

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:56.760
They won't accept
such a lame excuse!

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:58.560
Just back off.

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:00.510
I just have to win
the championship, right?

00:07:00.510 --> 00:07:01.480
Of course!

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:04.230
And let me remind you
of the position you're in!

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:07.070
Don't forget why you were
chosen as the Fighter!

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:09.780
Okay? The way things are,
your father will forever be...

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:13.950
I see that had some effect on you.

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:17.120
In any case, you were
completely out of line today.

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:22.790
I do understand your frustration
about your father's situation.

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:24.710
That's right.

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:26.670
Out of the countries
Major Ulube mentioned...

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:28.920
...Neo France and Neo Russia
are the only ones left.

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:33.220
What'd you do that for?!
I'm concerned for you!

00:07:33.630 --> 00:07:34.930
Who asked you?

00:07:34.930 --> 00:07:36.100
Where are you going?

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:37.390
Leave me alone.

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:39.930
Your job is to keep
the Gundam in top condition.

00:07:41.430 --> 00:07:44.190
Boy! What'll it take to
get the message across?!

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:45.480
Ouch!

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:53.950
It's Major Ulube's secret code.

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:07.960
It's a pleasure,
Princess Maria Louise.

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:10.090
You are as captivating as ever.

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:15.760
Princess, may I have
the honor of this dance?

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:16.890
Excuse me.

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:23.890
George de Sand.

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:25.720
What has brought you out here?

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:27.060
Look.

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:34.780
I never tire of its beauty.

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:37.280
It fills me with immense pride...

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:40.030
...being given the chance
to fight with this Gundam Rose.

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:41.740
How about me?

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:44.750
In your battles...

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:47.830
...would you not fight
for my honor as well?

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:48.790
George...

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:53.130
Of course.

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:56.210
But it is also for our country.

00:08:56.370 --> 00:08:57.090
Yes.

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:59.640
Once a great power in Europe...

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:02.350
...Neo France has a great
and glorious past.

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:04.390
The Gundam Fight gives us...

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:07.400
...the opportunity to rekindle
that honor and glory.

00:09:08.100 --> 00:09:11.480
Now it is my duty to bring the
championship to this nation.

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:14.450
Princess?

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:19.760
George...

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:23.620
"For his country..."

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:26.290
What could I do to
get his attention?

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:31.710
I know!

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:34.670
Princess!

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:37.800
The Princess has been kidnapped!

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:43.560
Wh-what is this?!

00:09:46.180 --> 00:09:47.440
I see!

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:59.360
Making them think I was kidnapped
by Neo Japan went well, but...

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:04.950
Thank you.

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:08.540
Uh, excuse me...

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:11.040
That will be 17 Neo Francs,
please.

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:18.260
This is unfortunate.

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:20.050
Please follow me!

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:22.600
This'll do, right?

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:23.890
Well, yes...

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:26.390
So!

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:28.880
Snuck out with no money, huh?

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:31.150
Princess of Neo France?

00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:33.920
Come on.
I just paid for your drink.

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:35.330
You can't blow me off.

00:10:35.330 --> 00:10:36.770
I shall send someone later.

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:38.070
Not so fast!

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:40.610
I've got a hot temper,
losing a battle and all!

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:43.720
You may have been humiliated
by Neo Japan...

00:10:43.720 --> 00:10:46.490
...but venting your frustrations
on a woman?

00:10:46.490 --> 00:10:47.910
Well, you certainly deserved to lose!

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:48.990
What'd you say?!

00:10:48.990 --> 00:10:50.580
You brat!

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:54.290
Think it'll be easy
getting out of here?

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:59.840
Isn't it me you want to
take your anger out on?

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:01.530
Why, you!

00:11:01.530 --> 00:11:05.010
I was just looking for someone
to trash as well!

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:06.260
Shut up!

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:18.730
Uh, pardon...

00:11:19.560 --> 00:11:21.060
Neo Japan Fighter...?

00:11:21.050 --> 00:11:21.950
Wrong guy.

00:11:22.590 --> 00:11:25.950
I understand you want to
fight my George.

00:11:25.940 --> 00:11:26.580
What?

00:11:27.290 --> 00:11:29.580
I can arrange to have him fight you.

00:11:38.500 --> 00:11:42.180
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:43.930
What?!

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:45.640
You want to fake a kidnapping?

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:47.380
"Come fight me!"

00:11:47.380 --> 00:11:51.060
"Otherwise your beloved princess
shall perish, never to be seen!"

00:11:52.160 --> 00:11:53.390
Look...

00:11:53.390 --> 00:11:58.070
...I can't imagine a Fighter like
George falling for such a trick.

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:02.150
He'll come! Of course!
Definitely!

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:04.530
Sounds interesting.

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:06.530
No, Domon!

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:08.370
Are you going to add kidnapping
to your record?

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:11.950
And look here.
An order from Major Ulube.

00:12:12.910 --> 00:12:15.130
He'll take care of the problem
of you interfering in a match.

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:18.630
So, in the meantime,
go to Neo Russia first.

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:23.380
I hear that their "Bolt Gundam"
is waiting for an opponent to fight.

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:26.090
Just because it's a tip from Ulube...

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:27.760
...doesn't mean it's reliable,
you know.

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:29.310
Then, Domon...

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:31.810
...keep in mind, you could be
taken off the mission at any time!

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:34.440
Then, he'll be like that forever!

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:41.860
Um...

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:45.240
Whatever the case may be,
are you or...

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:46.600
...are you not going to kidnap me?

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:49.950
Look!
The answer is obvious!

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:50.830
I will!

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:52.290
Domon!

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:55.610
Are you serious?!

00:12:55.610 --> 00:12:58.000
Yeah. I don't want to wait around!

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:59.260
But...

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:03.920
No! Wait! Domon!

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:07.470
I'm your partner!
You'll never get away with this!

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:10.470
She's fine there.

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:12.970
She has all the facilities
that she needs.

00:13:12.970 --> 00:13:14.770
What do we do about the
ransom note to George?

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:17.650
It's all taken care of.
Let's go.

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:24.900
I never want to see him again.

00:13:29.140 --> 00:13:30.070
What?

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:33.490
You found this letter at your café?

00:13:33.490 --> 00:13:35.540
Y-yes. And next to it, that hat.

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:38.330
There's no mistake, sir.

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:40.670
This belongs to Miss Maria Louise.

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:42.000
Let's see...

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:45.010
"Let us conclude
the battle by dawn."

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:47.030
"I shall wait in the abandoned area
along the Seine."

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:49.720
What shall we do?

00:13:50.090 --> 00:13:51.920
- I have no choice but to go!
- Right.

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:03.900
We're going! Gundam Rose!

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:12.450
Give me a break!
Did he forget that I'm a mechanic?

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:13.450
There!

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:16.450
It's open!

00:14:19.360 --> 00:14:21.380
Be more gentle!

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:23.130
That hurts!

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:24.960
I can't do any better than this!

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:27.980
Hey, do you have to
tie me up so tightly?!

00:14:27.980 --> 00:14:31.390
Don't worry, I can untie it
quickly when the time comes.

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:40.350
It's George!
My George has come for me!

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:49.610
Domon Kasshu.

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:53.990
I did excuse you for your rudeness
of interfering in my match.

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:58.620
However, kidnapping
Miss Maria Louise is unforgivable!

00:14:59.540 --> 00:15:00.790
So, what'll you do?

00:15:01.910 --> 00:15:04.540
Your crime shall
not go unpunished!

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:09.840
In that case...!
Gundam Fight! Standby!

00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:39.750
Ready...!

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:43.250
Go!

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:01.520
It's started!

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:05.690
Vulcan!

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:10.110
That's nothing!

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:25.630
Oh, George! At last, George
is fighting a battle for me!

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:26.500
Princess!

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:28.750
Why are you tied to
a tree like that?!

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:31.170
How did you manage to get out?

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:32.970
Not now.
We have to get to a safe place!

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:36.970
No. I must stay right here
to see George win.

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:40.180
I mean, after all,
he came here to fight for me.

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:42.390
Do you really believe that?

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:46.600
Don't you see? It doesn't really
matter what they say.

00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:49.480
Men don't think that way
when they're fighting.

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:52.400
Not true! You are wrong.
My George is different!

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:54.490
- Princess! What she says is true!
- What?

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:59.260
Yes, at this moment,
I am engaged in battle as a fighter!

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:00.540
Yes.

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:03.500
I see nothing before me
except this man!

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:13.970
Princess, put an end
to this kidnapping game.

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:15.630
Please flee to safety!

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:18.220
I can't untie it! It's too tight!

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:21.220
You can!
Look carefully, Rain!

00:17:24.650 --> 00:17:26.770
You let a woman distract you?!

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:39.570
Quite remarkable!

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:41.660
You are the first one to
deflect my attack!

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:43.870
But can you deflect this?!

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:57.930
The Pride of Neo France.
The ultimate weapon...

00:17:57.930 --> 00:17:59.260
..."Rose Bits!"

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:00.930
And now, a demonstration!

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:03.430
Rose Screamer!

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:11.110
This one again!

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:35.920
Th-this is...

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:41.140
I'm unable to move at all.

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:44.220
Enjoying this?
The transformable Rose Bits.

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:47.680
Now, allow me to graciously
finish you off.

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:51.690
You shouldn't assume that
you've won yet.

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:52.730
What?

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:57.860
Yes, there's a way!

00:18:59.250 --> 00:19:02.070
This hand of mine glows
with an awesome power.

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:04.660
Its burning grip tells me
to defeat you.

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:10.000
Now! The ultimate...
Shining Finger!

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:24.140
Th-this can't be!

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:32.850
Miss Maria Louise!

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:35.230
Running away?!

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:37.980
A knight never shows his back!

00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:45.410
What?

00:19:58.920 --> 00:19:59.800
What now?

00:20:00.470 --> 00:20:03.970
If I care only about the battle
and fail to save my princess...

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:05.940
...I will shame the de Sand family...

00:20:06.460 --> 00:20:08.430
...no, I will shame Neo-France.

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:11.560
As a representative of the nation...

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:14.220
...a Gundam Fighter shall not taint
the honor and dignity of the nation.

00:20:14.610 --> 00:20:15.860
Yes...

00:20:15.860 --> 00:20:20.030
In accordance with Article 6
of the International Regulations...

00:20:20.030 --> 00:20:21.190
...finish this!

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:23.860
You have won!

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:26.530
Now, finish me off!

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:45.640
I am very sorry.

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:49.150
I had no intention of putting
our Gundam Rose through this.

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:50.850
But...

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:52.930
...the head section
is still beautiful.

00:20:53.560 --> 00:20:55.520
I didn't expect him to stop there.

00:20:56.150 --> 00:21:00.150
He too must have shown me
the dignity of a warrior.

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:04.650
I'm sorry for what I've done...

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:07.240
Thank you very much.

00:21:08.320 --> 00:21:13.040
Your affection has given me
more honor than I deserve.

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:16.120
However, I am forever obliged
to continue fighting battles...

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:18.530
...with all my body and soul.

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:19.750
In that case...

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:25.470
Would you vow to continue
until you win the championship?

00:21:26.400 --> 00:21:27.470
Yes.

00:21:27.900 --> 00:21:28.940
I certainly will.

00:21:29.970 --> 00:21:32.110
Anything for my
Miss Maria Louise.

00:21:35.790 --> 00:21:37.270
I want to ask you something.

00:21:37.700 --> 00:21:40.310
How did you figure out
the kidnapping was staged?

00:21:40.940 --> 00:21:41.860
It was easy.

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:44.400
It's unlikely for someone
like you to have...

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:47.690
...such excellent command of
the proud French language.

00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:52.700
Well, I look forward
to seeing you again.

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:53.790
Yeah.

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:55.960
Hey, Domon.

00:21:56.790 --> 00:21:59.670
If I get in trouble,
would you protect me?

00:22:00.870 --> 00:22:03.920
No. I'd only do that for a princess.

00:22:07.300 --> 00:22:09.340
All right. Off to Neo Russia.

00:22:09.680 --> 00:22:10.800
Wait, Domon...!

00:22:28.320 --> 00:22:32.950
<i>Ikusen no tsukihi ga nagaretemo</i>
No matter how much time passes

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:37.330
<i>tadori tsukenu basho o</i>
There's a place I can never reach

00:22:37.620 --> 00:22:41.790
<i>samayoi motomenagara</i>
As I wander, continuing my search

00:22:42.250 --> 00:22:45.340
<i>aruite yuku</i>
I keep going forward

00:22:45.630 --> 00:22:52.510
<i>koibito yo,</i>
watashi no hitomi no oku de
Deep within my stare, my love

00:22:53.010 --> 00:22:58.230
<i>kasuka ni yureteiru shinjitsu ga</i>
There is a truth that gently floats

00:22:58.430 --> 00:23:03.480
<i>dore hodo tsutawaru no desho</i>
How much of it will you catch?

00:23:03.650 --> 00:23:10.030
<i>Kizutsuita kokoro to karada azukete</i>
Give me your injured body and spirit

00:23:10.410 --> 00:23:14.160
<i>atataka na kono mune de</i>
I will hold you against my warm heart

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:20.160
<i>umi yori mo fukaku nemutte</i>
So you can sleep deeper than the sea

00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:33.890
It's the moment you've
been waiting for!

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:37.320
As soon as he arrives in
Neo Russia to fight Bolt Gundam...

00:23:37.320 --> 00:23:39.590
...Domon is sent to prison.

00:23:39.950 --> 00:23:41.980
Will Domon be able
to safely escape...

00:23:41.980 --> 00:23:44.600
...and return to the Gundam Fight?

00:23:44.600 --> 00:23:49.610
And what is the true identity of the
mysterious prisoner, Argo Gulskii?

00:23:49.610 --> 00:23:52.520
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:52.520 --> 00:23:56.060
Great Escape!
A Captive Gundam Fighter.

00:23:54.600 --> 00:24:00.340
Great Escape!
A Captive Gundam Fighter

00:23:56.060 --> 00:23:59.000
Ready! Go!
